<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00054"/>00054 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;DTRACE&#32;SHORT&#32;MANUAL</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00055"/>00055 <emphasis role="comment">//</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00056"/>00056 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;1.&#32;General&#32;info</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00057"/>00057 <emphasis role="comment">//</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00058"/>00058 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;DTrace&#32;is&#32;a&#32;simple&#32;tracer&#32;that&#32;can&#32;be&#32;controlled&#32;at&#32;command&#32;line&#32;of&#32;the&#32;executable.</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00059"/>00059 <emphasis role="comment">//</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00060"/>00060 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;Please&#32;have&#32;a&#32;look&#32;into&#32;command&#32;line&#32;parameter&#32;options&#32;to&#32;find&#32;the&#32;correspondent&#32;DTrace&#32;parameters.</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00061"/>00061 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;There&#32;are&#32;only&#32;two&#32;command-line&#32;parameters:&#32;tracing&#32;file&#32;and&#32;tracing&#32;rule.</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00062"/>00062 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;At&#32;initialization,&#32;DTrace-module&#32;parses&#32;the&#32;rule&#32;and&#32;set&#32;up&#32;the&#32;tracing&#32;context.</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00063"/>00063 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;The&#32;tracing&#32;context&#32;is&#32;stored&#32;in&#32;a&#32;global&#32;variable.&#32;All&#32;trace-outputs&#32;should&#32;use&#32;this&#32;global&#32;context.</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00064"/>00064 <emphasis role="comment">//</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00065"/>00065 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;2.&#32;Parameters</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00066"/>00066 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;2.1&#32;Tracing&#32;file&#32;(--TraceFile)</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00067"/>00067 <emphasis role="comment">//</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00068"/>00068 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;Just&#32;a&#32;filename&#32;for&#32;a&#32;text-file.</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00069"/>00069 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;E.g.:&#32;--TraceFile=&quot;tracefile_rec.txt&quot;</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00070"/>00070 <emphasis role="comment">//</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00071"/>00071 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;2.2&#32;Tracing&#32;rule&#32;(--TraceRule)</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00072"/>00072 <emphasis role="comment">//</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00073"/>00073 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;Tracing&#32;rule&#32;describes&#32;when&#32;during&#32;a&#32;runtime&#32;a&#32;particular&#32;output&#32;should&#32;be&#32;activated.</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00074"/>00074 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;Tracing&#32;rule&#32;consists&#32;of&#32;tracing&#32;channel(s)&#32;and&#32;tracing&#32;condition(s).</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00075"/>00075 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;The&#32;construction&#32;of&#32;the&#32;rule&#32;is:&#32;&quot;channel_1,channel_2,...:condition_1,condition_2,...&quot;</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00076"/>00076 <emphasis role="comment">//</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00077"/>00077 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;Example&#32;for&#32;a&#32;tracing&#32;rule:&#32;--TraceRule=&quot;D_CABAC:poc==0&quot;</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00078"/>00078 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;Here,&#32;tracing&#32;channel&#32;is&#32;D_CABAC&#32;and&#32;condition&#32;is&#32;poc==0,&#32;which&#32;means&#32;CABAC&#32;tracing&#32;output&#32;is&#32;activated&#32;at&#32;POC&#32;0&#32;only.</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00079"/>00079 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;You&#32;can&#32;also&#32;use&#32;poc&gt;=2&#32;or&#32;set&#32;the&#32;range&#32;like&#32;poc&gt;=0,poc&lt;=3&#32;for&#32;example.</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00080"/>00080 <emphasis role="comment">//</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00081"/>00081 <emphasis role="comment">//</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00082"/>00082 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;2.2.1&#32;Tracing&#32;channel</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00083"/>00083 <emphasis role="comment">//</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00084"/>00084 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;Channels&#32;are&#32;defined&#32;in&#32;dtrace_next.h.&#32;Users&#32;can&#32;add&#32;their&#32;own&#32;channels.</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00085"/>00085 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;Just&#32;put&#32;the&#32;channel&#32;definition&#32;into&#32;enum-list&#32;AND&#32;add&#32;it&#32;to&#32;the&#32;next_channels-table&#32;in&#32;the&#32;function&#32;tracing_init().</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00086"/>00086 <emphasis role="comment">//</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00087"/>00087 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;2.2.2&#32;Tracing&#32;condition</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00088"/>00088 <emphasis role="comment">//</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00089"/>00089 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;Currently&#32;supported:&#32;poc&#32;(the&#32;currently&#32;processed&#32;poc)&#32;and&#32;final&#32;(&apos;0&apos;&#32;if&#32;currently&#32;in&#32;RD-search,&#32;&apos;1&apos;&#32;if&#32;the&#32;current&#32;state&#32;is&#32;final)</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00090"/>00090 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;NOTE:&#32;Conditions&#32;are&#32;added&#32;and&#32;updated&#32;during&#32;runtime&#32;through&#32;DTRACE_UPDATE(...).</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00091"/>00091 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;It&#32;updates&#32;the&#32;DTrace&#32;internal&#32;state,&#32;so&#32;channels&#32;can&#32;be&#32;activated&#32;at&#32;the&#32;right&#32;moment.</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00092"/>00092 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;If&#32;it&apos;s&#32;not&#32;updated&#32;properly&#32;(at&#32;right&#32;place&#32;in&#32;the&#32;code,&#32;e.g.&#32;too&#32;late),&#32;the&#32;trace&#32;output&#32;can&#32;become&#32;wrong.</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00093"/>00093 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;For&#32;example,&#32;&quot;poc&quot;-condition&#32;should&#32;be&#32;updated&#32;at&#32;the&#32;start&#32;of&#32;the&#32;picture(AccesUnit).</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00094"/>00094 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;Please&#32;look&#32;into&#32;source&#32;code&#32;for&#32;how&#32;the&#32;&quot;poc&quot;-condition&#32;is&#32;used.</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00095"/>00095 <emphasis role="comment">//</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00096"/>00096 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;3.&#32;Using&#32;of&#32;DTrace&#32;macros</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00097"/>00097 <emphasis role="comment">//</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00098"/>00098 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;The&#32;most&#32;used&#32;macro&#32;is&#32;DTRACE.&#32;It&apos;s&#32;like&#32;a&#32;printf-function&#32;with&#32;some&#32;additional&#32;parameters&#32;at&#32;the&#32;beginning.</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00099"/>00099 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;Format:</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00100"/>00100 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;DTRACE(&#32;tracing&#32;context,&#32;tracing&#32;channel,&#32;&quot;...&quot;&#32;[,params]&#32;);</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00101"/>00101 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;Example:</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00102"/>00102 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;DTRACE(&#32;g_trace_ctx,&#32;D_CABAC,&#32;&quot;EP=%d&#32;\n&quot;,&#32;bin&#32;);</emphasis>
<anchor xml:id="_dtrace__next_8h_source_1l00103"/>00103 <emphasis role="comment">//&#32;There&#32;are&#32;also&#32;macros&#32;for&#32;output&#32;of&#32;buffers,&#32;picture&#32;components&#32;or&#32;conditional-outputs&#32;available.&#32;Please&#32;have&#32;a&#32;look&#32;into&#32;dtrace_next.h.</emphasis>
